codex
The harness now records future baseline runs into their requested unique output directories and includes runtime, communication, and peak-memory fields in their result JSON. Existing legacy SplitFL/Federated files predate those fields, so the aggregator preserves their accuracy and explicitly marks unavailable measurements instead of fabricating values.
